      "sent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Message</title>\n<style>\n  td{overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word}\n  @media(max-width:620px){\n    .email-cell{padding:20px!important}\n    .header-note{float:none!important;display:block;line-height:1.5!important;margin-top:8px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f4f4;padding:30px 0;\">\n  <tr><td align=\"center\">\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;table-layout:fixed;background:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #dee2e6;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n      <!-- HEADER / LOGO BAR -->\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"email-cell\" style=\"background:#1a2e5a;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;padding:18px 32px;\">\n          <span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;\">\n        DAX Sourcing Group\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"header-note\" style=\"float:right;color:#adb5bd;font-size:11px;line-height:36px;\">Enterprise Security Procurement</span>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"email-cell\" style=\"padding:32px;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n          \n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Dear Julius Muth,</p>\n\n      <p>My name is <strong>Dr. Michael Kraus</strong>, Head of Enterprise Sourcing at <strong>DAX Sourcing Group</strong>.\n      We are conducting a structured vendor evaluation for our Automotive & Industrial Logistics division\n      (~4,500 workforce seats across EU operations) and your company,\n      <strong>your organization</strong>, has been shortlisted.</p>\n\n      <p>Our internal steering committee requires all shortlisted vendors to complete\n      <strong>Section 3</strong> of the attached RFP evaluation matrix\n      (<em>DAX_Security_Vendor_RFP_Matrix_v1.pdf</em>) before the submission deadline of\n      <strong style=\"color:#e63946;\">December 8, 2026</strong>.</p>\n\n      <p>Key details of our evaluation:</p>\n      <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"\n             style=\"border:1px solid #dee2e6;border-radius:4px;margin:12px 0;\">\n        <tr style=\"background:#f8f9fa;\">\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-weight:600;color:#1a2e5a;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #dee2e6;\">Client Division</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #dee2e6;\">Automotive & Industrial Logistics</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-weight:600;color:#1a2e5a;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #dee2e6;\">Scope (Seats)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #dee2e6;\">4,500 employees (EU)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"background:#f8f9fa;\">\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-weight:600;color:#1a2e5a;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #dee2e6;\">Submission Deadline</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #dee2e6;color:#e63946;font-weight:600;\">December 8, 2026</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-weight:600;color:#1a2e5a;width:40%;\">Second Contact</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;\"><a href=\"mailto:s.weber@enterprise-sourcing.org\" style=\"color:#1a2e5a;\">s.weber@enterprise-sourcing.org</a></td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <p>Please open the attached <strong>DAX_Security_Vendor_RFP_Matrix_v1.pdf</strong> and complete Section 3\n      (product scope, pricing tier, and reference contacts). Our procurement team will\n      follow up within 48 hours of receipt.</p>\n\n      <p>Looking forward to your response.</p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Kind regards,</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1a2e5a;\">Dr. Michael Kraus</strong><br>\n      <span style=\"color:#6c757d;font-size:13px;\">Head of Enterprise Sourcing | DAX Sourcing Group</span><br>\n      <a href=\"mailto:s.weber@enterprise-sourcing.org\" style=\"color:#6c757d;font-size:13px;\">s.weber@enterprise-sourcing.org</a></p>\n    \n        </td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"email-cell\" style=\"background:#f8f9fa;border-top:1px solid #dee2e6;padding:18px 32px;font-size:12px;color:#6c757d;\">\n          This message was sent on behalf of DAX Sourcing Group. If you believe you received this in error, please contact <a href='mailto:s.weber@enterprise-sourcing.org' style='color:#6c757d;'>s.weber@enterprise-sourcing.org</a>. All vendor information is handled under strict NDA.\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
